<title>USA: SFX completes Multi-Market merger.</title>
<headline>SFX completes Multi-Market merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>SFX Broadcasting Inc and Multi-Market Radio Inc said on Friday they completed their merger after shareholders of both companies approved the deal.</p>
<p>Multi-Market Class A and Series B preferred shareholders received 0.2983 shares of SFX Class A common stock for every Multi-Market share they held.</p>
<p>Shareholders of Multi-Market Class B common stock and of original preferred stock received 0.2983 shares of SFX Class B common stock per Multi-Market share held.</p>
<p>The combined company owns and operates or provide services to 80 radio stations in 23 markets.</p>
</text>
